    "body": "That check is there in the case proxy returns different objects at different times. There is no guarantee that [[Construct]] would construct what you're expecting to construct with a proxy because proxy can change the behavior of [[Construct]] each time it gets invoked. We can change this to a define time check if we're okay with allowing creation of a \"bad\" element in those cases.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
